=== compactified target-free candidates ===
none in the bounded scan

=== interpretation ===
The open word can avoid G on the AP wall, but the compactified wall symbol W repairs it.  A genuine counterexample would be a periodic arithmetic word avoiding both G and W.  The bad-subshift cycle counts show that coarse symbolic factors often admit spurious target-free cycles; the proof problem is to rule out arithmetic realizability of those cycles or refine the alphabet until they disappear.
